om2
note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception
note Replay exact-liveness wire validation. Zero override means absent; values are instruction indices.
fn ra_live kind ulong a ulong b long c long d ulong e ulong to long
if eq kind 0
if gt a 1
ret 9
end
if and eq a 1 gt b 160
ret 10
end
ret 0
end
if eq a 0
ret 0
end
if or ge e 160 lt b 0
ret 10
end
if or lt a ulong b lt a ulong c
ret 10
end
if ge a d
ret 10
end
ret 0
end
